    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Zip up your tactical vest and unleash your inner gun-fu slayer in this fast-paced, single-player, first-person shooter. Master fluid movement, equip devastating weapons and take down\u00a0countless foes as you seek revenge. Keep your score climbing with non-stop action and get rewarded as you progress!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Run &amp; Gun First-Person Shooter</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Perform action gun-fu moves</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Earn multipliers and retain your  streak through combos</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Maintain momentum by stealing and equipping weapons</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Survive by aggressive movement to avoid danger</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Face various environments and challenging foes</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Currently In Development</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Please note: Graphics and gameplay is subject to change upon release and does not represent final quality.</i></p>",
